---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const GROUP_URL = "https://www.facebook.com/share/g/14jtya1TGU2/";
---
<Base
  title="Community"
  description="Join the Pelvic Organ Prolapse Support Society, a free and private Facebook community for women with prolapse."
  current="/community/"
>
  <div class="narrow">
    <span class="label">Community</span>
    <h1>Women who have already been where you are</h1>
    <p>
      The Pelvic Organ Prolapse Support Society started as a Facebook group and
      grew into what it is now. It is a place where women ask the questions they
      cannot ask anywhere else, about symptoms, surgeries, pessaries, intimacy,
      fear, and hope, and get answers from people who genuinely understand,
      because they have lived it.
    </p>

    <h2>What you will find inside</h2>
    <ul class="spaced">
      <li>Real experiences. Pre op nerves, post op diaries, pessary tips, the wins and the setbacks</li>
      <li>A judgment free space to ask anything, at any hour</li>
      <li>Encouragement from women at every stage, from newly diagnosed to years past surgery</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Our ground rules</h2>
      <ul class="spaced">
        <li><strong>Kindness first.</strong> No judgment and no shame.</li>
        <li><strong>Shared experience is not medical advice.</strong> Always confirm decisions with your own healthcare provider.</li>
        <li><strong>What is shared in the group stays in the group.</strong> Privacy is sacred here.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p>It is free, it is private, and you will be welcomed.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.6rem;">
      <a class="btn btn--plum" href={GROUP_URL} rel="noopener">Join the Facebook group</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
